Z||000007||fierosound||01-05-2000||09:48 PM||||About Calendar Commander...<P>The calendar program is a fully functional (not disabled in any way) shareware program that works for 30 days after you install it. You can always reinstall again after the 30 days (or buy it). You can also do a search for security material for this program (or any other computer program) at <A HREF="http://www.astalavista.com" TARGET=_blank>www.astalavista.com</A>  <BR>||||reg||10
Z||000008||william_thorniii||01-06-2000||02:12 PM||||Count,<P>Sorry that plant was finally "cleaned" up.  That was a picture of the original assembly plant in MI.  Until last year the building still had a rather large Fiero emblem on the front that made for an excellent picture.  Supposedly the cars are stored inside the facility now along with some original PPG and Indy pace cars.  Check with Jason W. of the Michigan Fiero Club to verify any/all of this information.  He knows much better than I do.<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||8
